DTSTAMP:20261124T071500Z
DTSTART:20240612T080000Z
DTEND:20240612T080100Z
SUMMARY:FET scheduled delist (postponed)
DESCRIPTION:Status: postponed\nMarket: perp\nEffective time: 2024-06-12T0
 8:00:00Z\nSettlement described as: mark_price\nSource: https://t.me/hype
 rliquid_announcements/190\nFET-USD will be delisted on June 12 at 08:00 
 UTC. This shorter than usual notice is due to a lack of clarity around t
 he timing of the merger of FET\, AGIX\, and OCEAN to ASI. All positions 
 will be settled at mark price\, and open orders will be canceled. Close 
 any positions beforehand to avoid automatic settlement. After settlement
 \, FET-USD perps will be delisted\, and no new orders will be accepted.
URL:https://t.me/hyperliquid_announcements/190
END:VEVENT
